entries[293076] = { ["name"] = "Mallet of Thunderous Skins", ["text"] = "3.5 sec cast\nReagents:\nLong Regal Sinew (4), Spirit of the Bested (15), Blood-Stained Bone (50), Tempest Hide (50), Hardened Tempest Hide (25), Expulsom (10)\nCreate a Mallet of Thunderous Skins.\nQuest:\nInstruments of Destruction\nZone:\nZuldazar\n\nQuest:\nInstruments of Destruction\nZone:\nBoralus Harbor\n\nMallet of Thunderous Skins\nBinds when picked up\nUnique\nAllows you to interact with Drums of Primal Might, granting you a blessing of speed, might, or resilience.\nUse: Increases your Haste by 15%. Lasts 40 sec.\n\nYou will become Exhausted and be unable to benefit from Bloodlust, Heroism or Time Warp again for 10 min. (10 Min Cooldown)\nRequires Kul Tiran Leatherworking\n(150)\n\"Useful for shaping pieces of leather and as a percussive instrument.\"" }
